    "innovation": "This paper uses IPSL model simulations to analyze the climate impact of reduced dust during the mid-Holocene, demonstrating that the spatial pattern of dust forcing is crucial for determining the relative responses of the African and Indian monsoons and the Atlantic thermohaline circulation.",
