            "target_entity_type": "Source",
            "paragraph": "Compared to the previous reference version of the model (IPSLCM5A-LR; Dufresne et al., 2013), all model components and model resolution have been improved. For a complete model description, the reader is referred to papers presenting the new model version, the way the different forcing factors were introduced in the model and the model performances (Boucher et al., 2020; Lurton et al., 2020).",
